        "Content": "Features\r\n* Large corner garden\r\n* Exterior Insulation\r\n* End of terrace\r\n* New Front Door\r\n* 2 reception rooms\r\n* OFCH New Boiler\r\n* Large Garage\r\n* Parking\r\n* Well established estate\r\n* Close proximity to city centre\r\n* Cul de sac"
